  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting productive water use and efficient water management in paddy fields</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Piloting enhanced water use efficiency and water productivity approaches in paddy fields with a focus on their multi-functional and value-added roles in the target countries. Increasing awareness and providing evidence-based results on the benefits of enhanced water management and both roles of paddy fields. Supporting the inclusion of both roles of paddy fields into national policies and strategies.</narrative>
  </description>
